WEBVTT


00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.020
Japanese and South Korean girls

00:00:02.021 --> 00:00:05.281
grow up in cultures with strict social expectations.

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:11.160
In Japan, school rules can ban dyed hair or even relationships.

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:12.740
In Korea,

00:00:12.741 --> 00:00:17.241
beauty standards and academic pressure are intense from a young age.

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:20.840
Japan values harmony and modesty,

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:24.800
while Korea emphasizes success and appearance.

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:29.700
Both face social pressure in different forms no better,

00:00:29.701 --> 00:00:32.441
no worse, just different expectations.
